{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEAR DOWN SPACE TITANS\u00a0</strong>\u27a1\ufe0f<strong> LAND &amp; INFILTRATE\u00a0</strong>\u27a1\ufe0f<strong> RAID RESOURCES\u00a0</strong>\u27a1\ufe0f<strong> UPGRADE &amp; DOMINATE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/b13607713136a5aee17b95e291228c08.poster.avif?t=1772627786\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/b13607713136a5aee17b95e291228c08.webm?t=1772627786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/b13607713136a5aee17b95e291228c08.mp4?t=1772627786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outflank the enemy in your nimble Sentinel starfighter to tear down the defences of alien megastructures while under fire. When the self-destruct sequence is initiated, you can land on the deck and infiltrate with your remote Hyper Droid, to plunder the depths and pull off a high-stakes heist from within. Escape before everything explodes, and then spend your bounty on augments and upgrades for both your Sentinel and your Hyper Droid, before returning to battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAR DOWN SPACE TITANS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot an agile star fighter across the surface of colossal, procedurally-generated alien megastructures. Harness the silky smooth controls to dog-fight, dodge and destroy the surface defences, allowing you to land and infiltrate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/464a9f930c0dcbd4a5d0c846df1ab583.poster.avif?t=1772627786\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/464a9f930c0dcbd4a5d0c846df1ab583.webm?t=1772627786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/464a9f930c0dcbd4a5d0c846df1ab583.mp4?t=1772627786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLUNDER FROM WITHIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your Hyper Droid to pull off a high-stakes heist from within, as you hunt down the Mother-Brain to secure powerful upgrade pods. Steal your enemies form and weapons to turn their abilities against them, then ram raid everything to capture valuable resources and escape before the whole place goes boom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/113e966226fcc753434649ae082b43c4.poster.avif?t=1772627786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/113e966226fcc753434649ae082b43c4.webm?t=1772627786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/113e966226fcc753434649ae082b43c4.mp4?t=1772627786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE &amp; EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/ffa419feb35929e33222e8e33c18304c.poster.avif?t=1772627786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/ffa419feb35929e33222e8e33c18304c.webm?t=1772627786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/ffa419feb35929e33222e8e33c18304c.mp4?t=1772627786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you fall in battle, time rewinds, sending you back to Moonbase Alpha\u2014your hub for reinvention. Spend your hard-earned currency on game-changing upgrades that permanently enhance your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/f34d5b77be70a9732510eac73142c995.poster.avif?t=1772627786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/f34d5b77be70a9732510eac73142c995.webm?t=1772627786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/f34d5b77be70a9732510eac73142c995.mp4?t=1772627786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/1e639d421512882b1f5f1c1e58d5189d.avif?t=1772627786\" width=1060 height=1920 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2563010?t=1772627786","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/c758036794109b34215df34f82308d01e424df1c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772627786","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/aae9f0cdddaf644e62e7e20c540fe045ea9acc43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772627786","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/aae9f0cdddaf644e62e7e20c540fe045ea9acc43/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772627786","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"des